{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HORNY HOLIDAY</strong> is an adult comedy visual novel packed with point-and-click interactions, free-roam exploration, and three unique love interests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Jack</strong>, an IT manager nursing a brutal breakup, as he dives headfirst into a holiday house party full of flirty encounters, awkward humor, and unexpected romance. Every choice shapes his story: will it end in heartbreak, hilarity, or a happily ever after?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Jack\u2019s ex-girlfriend\u2019s \u201cburn box\u201d of memories, uncover hidden images, and discover spicy surprises as you navigate a night of temptation, laughter, and self-discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8b Three love interests, each with animated scenes and authentic sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Over 26,000 words, 2,200 HD images, and 140+ animations bring the party to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Uncensored HD animations with replay options to relive your favorite moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Multiple endings, from romantic bliss to comedic disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Free-roam, point-and-click gameplay with optional mini-games and outrageous party moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f <strong>Will Jack find new love, or just another hangover?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice, and the fun, are entirely up to you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"In the Yard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2677670/434ad7016ed9233f617fbdb9d48876fe769257b7.jpg"},{"name":"Burning Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2677670/56a2e23227a103b71238dcbabbe79da18631f54b.jpg"},{"name":"Invitation Accepted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamst